Subject: shapefiles missing projection information
Message-ID: <RIaBcGmTXdE.YJnSvjUKBQAJ@ctmm-user.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ctmm-user/c/RIaBcGmTXdE/m/YJnSvjUKBQAJ>
